#!/usr/bin/env python3
# apply_tsg_intrabar_fix1.py — ── TSG_MTM_INTRABAR_FIX1_20261101 ──
#
# Corrects TSG_MTM_INTRABAR_20261031 (Tigris intrabar MTM check). Review of
# run 37f9657a vs 93f2a3cc (1 Nov): of the ₹21L drop, ~₹6.7L was the form's
# exit_time 15:15 (sealed 15:26); the rest (₹53.85L → ₹39.51L at 15:26, run
# 2ee25cfb) was the intrabar check firing on 52 days the close never stopped.
# Two bugs:
#   1. It summed every leg's OWN worst price in the minute (short CE high +
#      short PE high + wings at their lows) — states no single spot path can
#      produce. 44 of the 52 extra stop days had all four legs open.
#   2. It stopped at −SL. Live decides −SL on the 1m close (LD2) and its only
#      intra-minute check is the HARD STOP at −SL × mtm_sl_hard_mult (1.05)
#      on the ~4 s refresh (tsg_live_core / tsg_manager). It also checked the
#      target intrabar, which live never does.
#
# Now (runner logic, matching live):
#   • intrabar level = mtm_sl × max(1, mtm_sl_hard_mult); 0 = off (≡ close).
#     Same config key + 1.05 default as live (Settings → TSG "Hard stop × SL").
#   • the minute is bounded by two COHERENT scenarios: spot at the top (every
#     CE leg at its high, every PE leg at its low, bought or sold alike) and
#     spot at the bottom (the reverse). Either at/below the level → the basket
#     exits that minute at the level (prices interpolated close → scenario,
#     paisa-rounded). A minute that CLOSES through the level also books at
#     the level (prev minute → close), as live's hard stop would.
#   • −SL itself, the target, trail, IV and bank stay on the minute close.
#   • diag: mtm_sl_hard_mult, mtm_hard_stop_days. Backtest → TSG form: "Hard
#     stop × SL (intrabar)" field (shown with INTRABAR).
#   !! Runs made 31 Oct–1 Nov with INTRABAR are not reproducible (the old
#      model is gone). MINUTE CLOSE is unchanged (proven identical).
#
#   EDIT backend/app/backtest/tsg/backtest_tsg_runner.py
#        backend/app/backtest/tsg/test_tsg_runner.py   (5 intrabar tests → 9)
#        backend/app/engine/tsg/test_tsg_sl_per_lot.py (stale ORIGINAL check
#            repaired — failing on main since 20261031 — + 5 end-to-end checks)
#        frontend/src/pages/Backtest.jsx
#   Requires apply_tsg_intrabar_skip_partial.py (TSG_MTM_INTRABAR_20261031).
#
#   cd <repo root> && python3 apply_tsg_intrabar_fix1.py [repo_root] [--allow-dirty] [--skip-tests]
#   then: ./desktop/build-scalp.sh both   (outside market hours)
#
# Run ONLY this script — it carries every edit it makes.

